{"slug":"abinitio-online-training","id":"3816","title":"Abinitio Online Training","description":"<h3>About Abinitio Online Training</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The <strong>AbInitio</strong> software is a Business Intelligence platform containing six data processing products: Co&gt;Operating System, The Component Library, Graphical Development Environment, and Enterprise Meta&gt;Environment, Data Profiler and Conduct&gt;It. It is a powerful graphical user interface-based parallel processing tool for ETL data management and analysis.</p>\n<h3>Prerequisites For Learning Abinitio Online Training</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Graduates/Post Graduates are eligible.</li>\n<li>Everyone must have knowledge on SQL and PL/SQL.</li>\n<li>Basic Knowledge on UNIX Shell Scripting.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Terms And Conditions</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>We will Provide Supporting to resolve Student practical Issues.</li>\n<li>We will provide server Access and 100% Lab Facility.</li>\n<li>Resume Preparation.</li>\n<li>Interview Questions &amp; Answers.</li>\n<li>We will conduct mock interviews. Student also gets 100% supporting before and after getting job.</li>\n</ul>","curriculumInfo":"1 Section21 Lessons10 Weeks","sections":[{"id":"43","title":"Abinitio Online Training Course Content","count":"21","collapsed":true,"items":[{"id":"3819","order":1,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/abinitio-online-training/lessons/introduction-to-ab-initio/","number":"2.1","title":"Introduction to Ab initio","status":"locked"},{"id":"3820","order":2,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/abinitio-online-training/lessons/ab-initio-architecture/","number":"2.2","title":"Ab Initio Architecture","status":"locked"},{"id":"3821","order":3,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/abinitio-online-training/lessons/graph-programming/","number":"2.3","title":"Graph Programming","status":"locked"},{"id":"3822","order":4,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/abinitio-online-training/lessons/introduction-to-dat-and-dml-files/","number":"2.4","ti